WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.452 --> 00:00:03.236
Lesson two. My body!

2
00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:11.356
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:13.579
Hello, Coco!

4
00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:21.359
Hello, Mimi! Look at Mimi. Mimi has a head, eyes, and a nose. Let's learn!

5
00:00:22.492 --> 00:00:25.843
Head! Say it with me. Head!

6
00:00:30.042 --> 00:00:34.342
Eyes! Say it with me. Eyes!

7
00:00:38.164 --> 00:00:41.881
Nose! Say it with me. Nose!

8
00:00:45.905 --> 00:00:49.505
Mouth! Say it with me. Mouth!

9
00:00:53.448 --> 00:00:57.215
Hands! Say it with me. Hands!

10
00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:04.274
Feet! Say it with me. Feet!

11
00:01:08.261 --> 00:01:11.692
Touch your head!

12
00:01:11.742 --> 00:01:15.152
Touch your nose!

13
00:01:15.202 --> 00:01:18.993
Clap your hands!

14
00:01:19.043 --> 00:01:22.455
Stamp your feet!

15
00:01:22.505 --> 00:01:23.655
Well done!

16
00:01:24.646 --> 00:01:26.264
Coco, where's your nose?

17
00:01:26.314 --> 00:01:29.753
Here! It's my beak! Hoo hoo!

18
00:01:29.803 --> 00:01:30.833
Ha ha!

19
00:01:31.578 --> 00:01:37.911
This is B. B is for ball. Ball! B is for bee. Bee!

20
00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:46.872
Fast game! Touch your eyes!

21
00:01:46.922 --> 00:01:50.185
Touch your mouth!

22
00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:53.539
Touch your head!

23
00:01:53.589 --> 00:01:56.764
Hands up!

24
00:01:56.814 --> 00:01:57.964
Super!

25
00:01:58.773 --> 00:02:05.777
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

26
00:02:05.827 --> 00:02:07.334
Bye-bye, friends!

